# Same format as .gitignore. Everything here stays out of the deploy.
#
# Nothing in this list is fetched at runtime. Every runtime fetch the game makes
# is a file under assets/ — the car manifest and the per-car skin.json, the
# material atlas, the radio playlist, the model manifest and its parts, and the
# written text in assets/text/ — and no .js or .html file in src/ or at the root
# references r.xml.
#
# data/ is build input, not content. tools/build_map.py turns the OSM extracts
# in it into src/game/mapdata.js and tools/build_ground.py turns the LiDAR
# raster into src/game/ground_data.js; the game imports those generated modules
# and never reads data/. data/raw alone is 2.0 GB of .laz and the raster built
# from it, and Cloudflare refuses any single file over 25 MiB.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.assetsignore
wrangler.toml
package.json
node_modules
tools/
docs/
gemini-inbox/
data/raw/
data/
r.xml
*.md
*.sh
*.py
.planning/

# Personal audio/reference imports must never enter a deployment.
assets/radio/
references/

# Local-only build output and tool state (review SR-15). Wrangler uploads the
# working tree, not git, so anything gitignored as "local" must be listed here
# too or it ships whenever it happens to exist on disk.
out/
public/
dist/
.openai/
.claude/
.planning/
assets/models/src/
gemini-inbox/
spike-log.txt
*.bat
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
